WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.050
Here's the one thing this check
could change, and doesn't.

2
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:08.062
For every Application Gateway policy not
in prevention, the check writes Learn's

3
00:00:08.062 --> 00:00:13.000
switch command, with the policy's resource
group and subscription, to a plan file.

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.712
For a Front Door policy it writes
a line pointing at the guide.

5
00:00:16.712 --> 00:00:17.962
Nothing runs either.

6
00:00:17.962 --> 00:00:22.655
A person runs the command after the
false-positive review, in a change window,

7
00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:27.349
because a switch sent by automation
before tuning blocks legitimate users.

8
00:00:27.349 --> 00:00:31.100
Learn documents the same command
in reverse for backing out.
